000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. SRCH.
000300 DATA DIVISION.
000400 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000500 01 TB PIC 99 OCCURS 5 INDEXED BY IX.
000600 01 K PIC 99 VALUE 0.
000700 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000800     PERFORM VARYING K FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL K > 5
000900         COMPUTE TB(K) = K * 10
001000     END-PERFORM.
001100     SET IX TO 1.
001200     SEARCH TB AT END DISPLAY "NONE"
001300         WHEN TB(IX) = 30 DISPLAY "FOUND " IX
001400     END-SEARCH.
001500     SET IX TO 1.
001600     SEARCH TB AT END DISPLAY "NONE"
001700         WHEN TB(IX) = 99 DISPLAY "FOUND"
001800     END-SEARCH.
001900     SEARCH ALL TB AT END DISPLAY "NONE"
002000         WHEN TB(IX) = 50 DISPLAY "ALL " IX
002100     END-SEARCH.
002200     SET IX TO 2.
